{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00573","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 永和 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享先蚕乐章 永和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳春开令序，韶苑畅和风。\n惟灵申广佑，利物表神功。\n绮会周天宇，黼黻藻寰中。\n庶几承庆节，歆奠下帷宫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}